	"changelog": "* Fixed: the vision data download could fail with a certificate error (CERTIFICATE_VERIFY_FAILED) on some PCs. VisionMate now asks Windows to fetch the missing security certificate and tries again by itself.\n* If the secure connection still can't be confirmed, VisionMate explains what to check instead of asking you to check your internet connection.",
